==Information==
===Format===
*'''Group Stage:''' ''November 11<sup>th</sup> - 13<sup>th</sup>''
**Round Robin with two groups
**All matches are {{Ft|3}}
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 3 teams}} from each group advance to '''Playoffs'''
*'''Playoffs:''' ''November 20<sup>th</sup> - 22<sup>nd</sup>''
**Single elimination bracket
**All matches ''(excl. Grand Finals)'' are {{Ft|3}}
**Grand Finals are {{Ft|4}}
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams from Korea}} advance to {{LeagueIconSmall/owcs}} [[Overwatch_Champions_Series/2026/World Finals|World Finals]]
***If '''{{team|T1}}''' makes the top 2, the slot will pass down to the {{Bgcolortext|third|3rd}} highest placing Korean team due to already having qualified via {{LeagueIconSmall/overwatch champions series}} [[Overwatch_Champions_Series/2026/Asia/Stage_3/Korea|Korea Stage 3]]
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 1 team from Japan or Pacific}} advances to {{LeagueIconSmall/owcs}} [[Overwatch_Champions_Series/2026/World Finals|World Finals]]
*'''Hero Bans'''
**Each team bans 1 hero per map, with the ban impacting both teams
**Each ban must be from a different role than the other team's ban
**Teams can only ban a hero once per series, but may repeat a ban from the opposing team
**The higher seeded team or team that has lost the last map chooses to ban first or second

